out in reality. Julia posts in a more genuine way. But Hillary thinks she does it to death and lacks real life."], "length": 4847, "dataset": "samsum", "pred": " Julia and Gail are talking about social media. Gail thinks that Julia is addicted to social media. Julia thinks that she is not addicted and that she posts things that people like. Gail thinks that Julia posts things that she doesn't do. Julia thinks that Gail is spying on her. Gail says that she is not spying on Julia. Julia says that Gail is spying on her. Gail says that Julia is straightforward and that she posts things that she does. Julia says that she posts things that people like. Gail says that Hillary thinks that Julia has no life in real life. Julia says that Hillary is a"}
