ealous of Kyle's job at his uncle's construction site. Kyle is planning to ask his brother to get them some vodka and cigarettes. They are going to meet at the club at 6ish.\nSummary: The narrator is talking to her friend about her boyfriend. She says that he is very jealous and controlling. She is afraid of him and doesn't know what to do. Her friend advises her to leave him.\nSummary: The narrator is talking to her friend about her boyfriend. She says that he is very jealous and controlling. She is afraid of"}
